MODULE: LocalWorkExceedsBound
TARGET: TurnServedWithinBound
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: local admission work consumes more than the finite opportunity budget
PERTURBS: AwaitInTurn

--- FIND
AwaitInTurn(g) ==
    /\ timer[g] = "fired" /\ turn[g] = "timer"
    /\ timer' = [timer EXCEPT ![g] = "dispatch"]
    /\ age' = [age EXCEPT ![g] = IF queued[g] THEN @ + 1 ELSE @]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<turn, queued, served, operation>>
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: local admission work consumes more than the finite opportunity budget
AwaitInTurn(g) ==
    /\ timer[g] = "fired" /\ turn[g] = "timer"
    /\ timer' = [timer EXCEPT ![g] = "dispatch"]
    /\ age' = [age EXCEPT ![g] = IF queued[g] THEN Bound + 1 ELSE @]
    /\ UNCHANGED <<turn, queued, served, operation>>
--- END
